; a 120 mm HE round fired level from in front of your chest, the way you face: aim at a wall.
; (a spawned "LAW" keeps its own motor and orientation and flies off; the shell has the same
; blast, 150, and goes where it is pointed. Your own shouldered LAW also breaches on a hit.)
_d = getDir player
_p = getPos player
_s = "Shell120" camCreate [(_p select 0) + 2 * sin _d, (_p select 1) + 2 * cos _d, 2.2]
_s setVelocity [250 * sin _d, 250 * cos _d, 0]
